      "created_at": "2011-10-24T15:22:28.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I kind of picture Legacy carrying Absolute Zero, a la Iron Man and Captain America, only AZ hates it instead of them being <a href=\"http://30.media.tumblr.com/tumblr_lr6fk9yfU91r2idyio1_500.png\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">BFFs</a>.</p>\n<p>The Wraith totally has a plethora of sweet vehicles for all occasions, but prefers a tricked out, high tech <a href=\"http://media.comicvine.com/uploads/0/9490/221211-72648-huntress.jpg\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">motorcycle</a>.</p>",
